/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Crash core dumps (e.g. a linker OOM writes `core.<pid>` to the cwd): never committed.
# Numbered, so a source file named core.rs or core.ts is not ignored with them.
core.[0-9]*
*.log

# ── AI / tooling state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.agents/
.gemini/
.aider*
.cursor/

# ── Scratch / planning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
scratch/

# `cargo xtask dist` writes the release tarball and its checksums here.
dist/

# ── Environment & Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Editors & IDEs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.zed/
.idea/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
.DS_Store

# The plan is kept outside the repository, under scratch/.
/ROADMAP.md
